WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.100
A Lovely Date with Kazune-kun!?

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:37.590
Who is the person you love?

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:40.010
What is this all of a sudden?

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:42.640
In short, it's Hanazono-san, right?

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:46.470
What're you saying, Micchi?

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:48.600
There's no way Kazune-kun would lo-

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:49.310
You're right.

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:01.200
It's Karin.

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:05.120
How unexpected of you, Kazune-kun.

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:07.290
I didn't think you'd tell me that easily.

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:09.660
You would probably have just pulled it out of me.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.540
Well then, I'm borrowing this.

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:13.750
Okay.

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:18.510
You really do look like the professor.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:23.970
Your eyes, your nose, your lips,…

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:25.680
they're identical to the professor's.

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:30.980
You don't know anything about me, do you?

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:32.770
That's because I'm not my father.

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:34.770
I understand.

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:39.240
The professor is the protector of my life.

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:40.990
Protector of your life?

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:46.700
That ring is an important item that I got from the professor.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.950
If you find out anything, please tell me about it.

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:50.960
Okay, I understand.

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:53.170
They're coming this way!

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:55.340
I've gotta get out of here!

00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:00.210
Kazune-kun loves me?

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:05.470
Kazune-kun always teases me,…

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:06.890
and he's always angry at me.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:10.640
And he's the person Himeka-chan loves.

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:12.140
This is…

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:15.900
This must all be a lie!

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.650
Art Room

00:03:32.710 --> 00:03:34.330
What is this painting?

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:36.130
It might be a new style of art.

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:56.600
Karin-chan.

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:01.610
Himeka-chan!

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:05.110
Is something wrong?

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:08.160
There's nothing at all wrong with me!

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:14.830
Karin-chan, did something happen?

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:23.420
She probably doesn't have any energy because she hasn't eaten, is that right?

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:26.380
Kazune-kun!

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:29.140
It's Kazune-kun.

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:32.020
Hey, Karin, on the way home today…

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:34.350
…are you free?

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:39.310
I-I've got some things to do today!

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:39.730
Things?

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:42.530
I-I was going to go home with Micchi today.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:43.940
Right, Micchi?

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:47.910
Well, that's how it is, so we're going on ahead!

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.790
I'm sorry, Micchi…

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:56.620
for suddenly getting you involved in this.

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:03.000
We're finally alone.

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:08.010
It would've been better if you'd just been honest about this sooner.

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:12.760
What are you doing, Micchi?

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:13.850
"What"?

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:15.560
It's just a kiss.

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:18.190
I mean, why do you want to kiss me?

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:21.770
You're one to speak, after forcing me to come with you.

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:26.360
I didn't know you had any interest in me.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:27.530
What?

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:36.200
N-No!

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:39.120
I already have someone I love!

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:45.380
Is that Kazune-kun?

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:47.470
N-No.

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:03.310
Do you know who Kazune-kun loves?

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:10.320
He has one you know. Someone he loves.

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:13.660
What a shame.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:17.540
Even though it was my target.

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:21.500
Kazune-kun was my target.

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:24.250
It seems we're rivals from now on.

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.550
Good luck, Hanazono-san.

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:27.340
Bye.

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:32.090
Jeez, what just happened?

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:01.830
It's just a normal ring.

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:25.940
Thank goodness, there's nobody he-

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:28.070
Welcome home, Karin-chan!

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:33.070
Shii-chan! Don't scare me like that!

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:35.320
What's wrong, Karin-chan?

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:37.490
You're being kind of sneaky.

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:39.200
Well, you see…

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:42.660
I can't tell Shii-chan after all!

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:44.170
Karin-chan?

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:47.210
Never mind, it's nothing.

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:53.170
Welcome home, Karin-chan.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:57.050
Hi-Hi-Hi-

00:07:57.050 --> 00:07:58.180
Himeka-chan.

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:01.100
Is something the matter?

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:03.690
A termite!

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:06.560
Where?

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:16.910
A termite is a friend of the cockroach.

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:20.290
Himeka-chan seems happy.

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:21.870
It's useless.

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:25.120
I can't look at Himeka-chan with an honest face.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:27.460
If I meet Kazune-kun like this, I'd-

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:28.460
Hi, Karin.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:31.300
- There it is!

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:31.300
- What? There what is?!

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:34.800
Right now, there is…

00:08:35.090 --> 00:08:36.340
a termite.

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:37.970
What was that…

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:43.810
A confession isn't something to talk about, is it?

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:47.060
I can't look them honestly in the face.

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:55.530
I'm going to leave my room.

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:58.280
Goodbye.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:00.660
Even though it was for a short time,…

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:03.490
it was fun.

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:06.250
Adieu.

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.840
Karin-chan's always a bit strange…

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:12.880
but today she's a nutcase.

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:15.630
Let's go, Shii-chan.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:18.380
The ship will depart soon.

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:19.640
S-Ship?

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:22.890
I can hear the sound of the steam whistle.

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:33.820
Good, we should be okay now.

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:36.990
Ah yes, Karin.

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:40.200
What?

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:49.620
Please go out with me on tomorrow's holiday.

00:09:58.090 --> 00:09:59.550
Keep it a secret from Himeka.

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:13.650
What is this about?

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:15.730
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:19.270
I am God!

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:24.230
You moron.

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:24.230
It's a croquette!

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:45.760
What's keeping Kazune-kun?

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:48.890
Keep this a secret from Himeka.

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:51.850
To ensure we don't get exposed, let's leave at different times.

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:56.610
Even though we live in the same house, that's just weird.

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:58.360
This is just as if-

00:10:58.360 --> 00:10:59.070
Karin!

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:01.740
I'm sorry.

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:10.120
Jeez, you kept me waiting.

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:11.080
I'm sorry.

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:15.670
Well then, let's go.

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:16.790
Okay.

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:23.590
- <i>This is just like a date.</i>

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:21.630
- To make up, I'll treat you.

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:25.600
- You haven't had lunch yet, so you must be hungry.

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:54.870
No-no, you're wrong!

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:56.750
This isn't a date!

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:01.210
What do you want?

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:03.590
Um…

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:08.680
Okay… I'm going to order something that isn't normal on a date.

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:10.890
Um…

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:16.150
There isn't any girl that would ask for an Eel Box during a date.

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:17.480
How's this?

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:25.150
It's good!

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:28.200
I see. So, it's good.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:36.040
Don't eat so quickly.

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:39.750
I don't want a mood like this!

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:45.630
Kazune-kun, what do you think about things involving the Earth?

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:49.050
What about the decline in birth rate?

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:50.600
What are you talking about?

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:54.020
This is good.

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:56.980
Nobody has serious conversations like this on a date.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:59.110
Karin, what flavour is your ice cream?

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:00.860
Huh? It's Mint…

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:04.280
It's good.

00:13:04.820 --> 00:13:06.450
Try mine too.

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:07.160
It's Vanilla flavour.

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:08.780
I don't want to!

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:13.490
Jeez, this is going completely according to Kazune-kun's pace.

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:23.800
Hey, you two.

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:26.800
You on a date?

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:28.680
Don't be absurd!

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:30.220
We're not on a date.

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:33.930
Brat, you sure have a cute girl with you.

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:36.730
Brats these days are so precocious.

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:40.980
What is this arranged development?

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:43.730
I know! I should just transform!

00:13:44.440 --> 00:13:48.400
Normal girl wouldn't become a goddess on a date, right?

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:50.530
Okay! I am Go-

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:56.290
Karin, we're going to run for it.

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:57.790
Okay!

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:08.550
Kazune-kun is cool.

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:11.180
But, this isn't a date!

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:17.930
I already have someone I love.

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:22.810
I don't love Kazune-kun.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:40.960
So cute!

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.710
So girls like that kind of stuff.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:46.800
I don't get it.

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:52.970
Would Himeka like something like that?

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:53.470
Huh?

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:56.350
Yes, I think she will.

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:59.770
Our tastes are alike.

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:03.100
Then I'll go with this.

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:07.650
I'm sorry, can you please put a birthday card on this, as a present.

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:08.110
Sure.

00:15:12.740 --> 00:15:17.120
I didn't know what to get for Himeka's birthday.

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:19.000
I see.

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:22.170
It was a good thing I had you come along.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:23.750
Thank you.

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:25.080
I'm sorry for making you wait.

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:28.670
So that's why we had to keep it a secret from Himeka-chan.

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:31.550
But instead I…

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:39.140
Kirika-senpai!

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:40.730
Karin-chan.

00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:46.270
Shopping glasses guy is with you.

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:47.980
I'm not a "shopping glasses guy".

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:49.780
I'm Karasuma Kirio.

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:52.320
To meet you out here…

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:54.110
That's our line.

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:55.950
Are you on a date?

00:15:56.370 --> 00:16:00.160
No, you're mistaken! That's not it at all.

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:05.960
What about you? We finally have a day of, why aren't you on a date?

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:08.000
What about your girlfriend?

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:10.420
I don't have a girlfriend.

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:12.260
Really?

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:13.930
Yes, why?

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:16.510
It's nothing.

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:18.510
Let's go, Kirika.

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:21.270
We don't have time to face them today.

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:22.640
Okay.

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:24.480
See you later, Karin-chan.

00:16:24.890 --> 00:16:26.350
See you at school.

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:26.940
Yes!

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:06.890
So the girl that was with him the other day wasn't his girlfriend.

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:10.060
I'm glad.

00:17:11.570 --> 00:17:12.730
It's fine like this.

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:16.990
I have Kirika-senpai.

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.830
Today… was fun.

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:24.820
It was fun, wasn't it?

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:33.420
I like this place.

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:38.840
I love the sunset you can see from here.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:45.180
Karin.

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:50.480
Thanks for going out with me today.

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:04.410
If I didn't know about that, I bet today would've been a lot more fun.

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:10.250
You're right. It's Karin.

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:16.710
It would have been better if I hadn't heard that confession.

00:18:26.350 --> 00:18:28.310
Happy birthday Himeka-chan!

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:29.850
Happy birthday.

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:32.110
Thank you.

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:35.780
Here, Himeka-chan. It's a present.

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:41.240
It's a bug figure.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:44.030
It's just like the real thing.

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.700
I'm happy.

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:52.580
Thank you for this.

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:55.300
Did you find anything out, Kazune-kun?

00:18:55.840 --> 00:19:00.840
That ring… for some reason it can't provide the power of a god.

00:19:03.430 --> 00:19:05.560
Why is that?

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:07.350
I don't know that yet.

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:11.810
All I know, is that in reaction to some power, some characters appear on the ring.

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:14.190
That might become some sort of clue.

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:16.190
What characters were they?

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:20.700
When there is a full moon, the seal of the Gods will dissolve.

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:23.280
When there is a full moon…

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:30.000
I'm going to continue investigating things.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.210
If I find out something, I'll tell you.

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:38.210
You're being quite cooperative.

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:42.760
Can it be that you've fallen in love with me?

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:46.800
It's because women are annoying.

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:58.730
Congratulations, Himeka.

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:00.110
Congratulations.

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:02.450
Thanks.

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.860
This is your birthday present.

00:20:04.860 --> 00:20:07.330
I'm happy. Can I open it?

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:08.200
Of course.

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:12.330
It's cute.

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:14.750
It looks good on you, Himeka.

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:17.210
I'll treasure this.

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:20.420
Thanks you, Kirio-chan,  Kirika-chan.

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:31.100
I'm glad that her birthday passed without any problems this year, aren't you, nii-san?

00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:35.520
Himeka has cheered up lately.

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:39.110
What if we continue just like this, and don't do anything…

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:40.900
That's why you're naive.

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:42.440
Nii-san.

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:46.030
We have no idea when the day of Aeon's collapse will be.

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:49.370
We have to finish this quickly, for her sake.

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:59.170
I'm scared.

00:21:00.420 --> 00:21:04.550
That tenacity you have, will one day ruin you.

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:14.730
Thank you, Karin-chan.

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:22.980
You chose this pendant together with Kazune-chan, right?

00:21:22.980 --> 00:21:26.320
Yeah. I'm glad you like it.

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:34.660
It's the first time Kazune-chan bought me an accessory.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:40.290
As a present, I made a cake for you.

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:42.380
A cake?

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:57.850
It's shape sort of collapsed.

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:04.570
I'm happy.

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:08.490
Thank you, Karin-chan.

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:17.040
Happy birthday.

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:18.250
Happy birthday.

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.600
Totsuzen no sutorii hajimaru yo

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.600
The story has suddenly begun…

00:22:55.600 --> 00:23:03.860
Ring hikari dasu

00:22:55.600 --> 00:23:03.860
…with the ring shining.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
Ate no nai tabiji wo kimi to

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
I'm on an aimless journey with you,

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Saa, hashire

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Come, let's run.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Ima ruriiro somatta kono omoi wo

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Right now, these azure feelings that have built up…

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
Yume mite koi shite

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
…that I've been dreaming of, and love…

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.130
Sora made ukande hakanai anemone

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.130
…are floating up into the sky, like a never wilting anemone.

00:23:45.130 --> 00:23:52.080
Todoku koto no nai tegami hoshi no you ni

00:23:45.130 --> 00:23:52.080
This letter that cannot be delivered, will become like a star…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
So yo kaze sayonara aa…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
Yes, it will have have to bid the wind farewell.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:10.370
The Beach

00:24:06.150 --> 00:24:08.150
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:09.480
The beach!

00:24:09.730 --> 00:24:12.530
Na! When you think of summer vacation, you should go to the beach, right?

00:24:12.530 --> 00:24:15.620
Gi! Under the golden sun and cheerful bikinis!

00:24:15.660 --> 00:24:18.910
Sa! Well, let's make some seaside memories!
